structural_change.description:
For non-text corrections. Shape varies by type:
- speaker_reassignment: {new_speaker_id, new_speaker_role}
- qa_split: {split_after_word_id, new_q_paragraph_speaker_id, new_a_paragraph_speaker_id}
- objection_split: {objection_start_word_id, objection_end_word_id, objector_speaker_id?} — extraction boundary only; objector_speaker_id is OPTIONAL attribution (omit = unidentified, never fabricated)
- objection_attribution: {new_attorney_name, new_speaker_role}
- examination_section_change: {new_section: 'DIRECT'|'CROSS'|'REDIRECT'|'RECROSS'|'FURTHER_...'}
- off_record_boundary_mark: {boundary: 'start'|'end', recess_time_note}
